Quicker and easier shopping with Tesco.
Dear Mr Mason,
We know how important it is that shopping online is both quick and easy, that's why we've introduced a number of changes and improvements to make our site easier to use - and your life easier. Here's a quick guide:
Special offers are easier to spot and access
'Search' has been improved to make finding what you want easier
We've sped up the site to make shopping easier
We've made it easier to tell your personal shopper what you want 
New intelligent Search
 Weve improved Search to make it much easier to find exactly what youre looking for.
Heres an example of the improved search results youll see if you typed in bread.
Speedier service
 Waiting for the site to download is not how you want to spend your time, so weve speeded up the site to make shopping quicker.
Take note
 Weve made it easier for you to tell your Personal Shopper exactly what you want; for example green bananas.
Heres where youll be able to add notes.
Did you know?
 Our Personal Shoppers choose your shopping with the same care you would
 You can check if a delivery slot is available before you shop online
 Refrigerated vans keep your groceries in tip-top condition until they arrive with you
 Your credit/laser card information is secure with tesco.ie 
Any problems with your online grocery shopping? Just call 00 800 00 225533*
We hope these changes make shopping online quicker and even more convenient, 
logon to tesco.ie today
.
Best wishes
Tesco.ie 
Remember you earn Clubcard points on every purchase
* Helpline open 9am - 11pm Mon to Sat, 10am - 6pm sun
 If you would prefer not to receive emails with news and special offers from Tesco.ie, please click here: Unsubscribe. It may take up to five 
 working days to 
unsubscribe
. 
