VITAL SIGNS FOR JULY 19, 2002
David Berlind
Hey, thief! This laptop is locked
Try stealing my notebook and 
Caveo Anti-Theft
 will yell at you louder and louder -- before resorting to an unstoppable, ear-piercing screech. It's motion detection on a PC Card.
And it's virtually foolproof
